course: dictionary
lesson: 3221
title: Entangle: caught in a tangle
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Entangle means to catch something in a tangle so it cannot get free. Look at the words around it for clues. «Their curls got entangled together» tells you their hair became twisted up with each other, so it was hard to pull apart.
explain: Entangle can also mean to twist things together in a mess, or to get someone caught up in a difficult situation. A person can get entangled in lies or quarrels. Often we say «get entangled» or «become entangled in».
explain: Animals can get entangled in fishing nets, plastic rings or litter. This is one reason we pick up rubbish: it can trap animals and hurt them.
fact: Entangle means to catch something in a tangle so it cannot get free.
fact: «Entangled» is the past form: «The bird was entangled in a plastic ring.»
fact: Entangle can mean to twist things together in a mess, as with hair or string.
fact: Entangle can also mean to get someone involved in a messy situation, as in «entangled in lies».
fact: Entangle is often used in the passive, as in «get entangled» or «become entangled in».
exercise: «Their curls got entangled together.» What does entangled mean here? | Dried quickly in the sun | Cut short with scissors | *Twisted up and caught together | Brushed smooth and neat
exercise: A bird got entangled in a plastic ring. What does this mean? | *It was caught in a tangle and could not get free | It sang a happy song | It flew very high over the sea | It ate the ring
exercise: Which sentence shows someone caught up in a messy situation? | *He got entangled in lies and could not find a way out | They laughed at the birthday party | She ate her lunch quickly | The sun was warm on the grass
test: Which word means to catch something in a tangle so it cannot get free? | Stroll | Glimmer | *Entangle | Whisper
test: «The fishing nets entangled the dolphins.» What does this tell us? | The dolphins were hungry for fish | *The nets caught the dolphins so they could not get free | The nets were brand new and shiny | The nets made the dolphins swim faster
exam: Why should we pick up litter near the sea? | *Animals can become entangled in it and be hurt | Litter helps the fish grow bigger | Litter is too heavy to carry | Litter makes the sand taste salty
